<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German first division summaries on Friday:</p>
<p>Hansa Rostock 3 (Beinlich 32, Lange 35, Baumgart 38) St Pauli 1</p>
<p>(Pisarev 59). Halftime 3-0. Attendance 20,500</p>
<p>Werder Bremen 1 (Herzog 32 - penalty) Bayer Leverkusen 1</p>
<p>(Feldhoff 70). 1-0. 31,115.</p>
